{'symbol': 'NDSN', 'date': '2023-05-10 08:30:00', 'title': 'NORDSON CORPORATION DECLARES THIRD QUARTER DIVIDEND FOR FISCAL YEAR 2023', 'text': 'WESTLAKE, OHIO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NORDSON CORPORATION (NASDAQ: NDSN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A FISCAL YEAR 2023 THIRD QUARTER CASH DIVIDEND IN THE AMOUNT OF $0.65 PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE ON JUNE 6, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 23, 2023. THIS AMOUNT EQUALS THE $0.65 PER COMMON SHARE DIVIDEND PAID IN THE SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL YEAR 2023. NORDSON CORPORATION IS AN INNOVATIVE PRECISION TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT LEVERAGES A SCALABLE.'}